    {
      "id": "product-node-smoke-current-result",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Runtime Pass Check",
      "position": {"x": 430, "y": -140},
      "width": 520,
      "height": 360,
      "visible": true,
      "ports": [
        {"id": "left", "label": "left", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 180},
        {"id": "bottom", "label": "bottom", "direction": "output", "dataType": "value", "angle": 90}
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "Runtime Pass Check",
        "status": "ready-to-verify",
        "markdown": "## Expected result\n\nRun the Twilite Product Graph bridge. It should create a `Twilite` node whose root surface renders from `root.node`. The instance should have `root`, `user-benefit`, and `document` handles discovered from declarations sharing `nodeId: twilite`; the `document` handle must point at the sibling document graph.\n\nThe authored specimen beside this check records the expected resolved contract so a newly bridged instance can be compared directly."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "product-node-smoke-identity-contract",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Corrected Identity Contract",
      "position": {"x": -250, "y": 420},
      "width": 560,
      "height": 360,
      "visible": true,
      "ports": [
        {"id": "top", "label": "top", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 270},
        {"id": "right", "label": "right", "direction": "output", "dataType": "value", "angle": 0}
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "Identity Contract",
        "markdown": "## Identity direction\n\n`nodeId` names the node concept that persists across graphs. `graphId` names the graph contributing part of that node.\n\n```text\nProduct declaration:  nodeId = twilite, graphId = product\nDocument declaration: nodeId = twilite, graphId = document\n```\n\nThe product and document are separate graph spaces belonging to the same `Twilite` node concept."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "product-node-smoke-pass-contract",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Pass Contract",
      "position": {"x": 430, "y": 420},
      "width": 560,
      "height": 400,
      "visible": true,
      "ports": [
        {"id": "top", "label": "top", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 270},
        {"id": "left", "label": "left", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 180}
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "Pass Contract",
        "markdown": "## The smoke test passes when\n\n1. Bridging the product graph contributes `Twilite` as a creatable node.\n2. The instantiated node renders the product graph's declared root surface.\n3. Subgraph discovery finds the document declaration for the same `nodeId`.\n4. Its public document port appears as a visible `document` handle.\n5. The local instance keeps its own graph-local `id`; declaration identity remains `nodeId: twilite`.\n6. No portal or copied document content is required in the consuming graph."
      }
    }
